  - crates/wireless/src/main.rs     ACCESSORY_NAME CarLink -> K230 (BT EIR 广播名)
  - src/iap2/driver.rs              0x1D01 识别名 CarLink -> K230 (两处)
  - crates/wireless/src/bt_driver.rs 主动 4301 上限 3->120 / 间隔 5s->3s /
                                    识别后主动推 0x5703 (CARPLAY_AUTO_5703=0 可关)

